WHO   — Tommy Webber — Laredo — the kid pilot, grown
WHAT  — The grown-up child actor: stuck as 'the kid who could fly,' who turns out to actually be able to fly the real thing.
WHERE — GQT · Galaxy Quest (1999)  Framework inputs: Galaxy Quest (1999, dir. Dean Parisot, DreamWorks); verified cast & facts  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the parody includes the child-star trope — and then lets him be genuinely, thrillingly good.
HOW   — By piloting the real ship with the skill the show only pretended he had, minefield and all.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
